  "note": "The pretraining corpus is hard truncated before the cut date and the scored rows are all post-cut, so no scored transaction was in the pretraining data. The corpus does include pre-cut rows of the test accounts, which is the same condition the shipped transfer table runs under, and we state it rather than implying otherwise."
